    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 21,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# CloudFront · distribución web\nMétricas globales consultadas en us-east-1. Los porcentajes 4xx/5xx ya vienen expresados en %. Transferencia de entrada y salida por minuto."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 23,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "CloudFront · peticiones/min",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "period": 60,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/CloudFront",
            "Requests",
            "DistributionId",
            "${distribution_id}",
            "Region",
            "Global",
            {
              "label": "Peticiones"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "legend": {
          "position": "bottom"
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "label": "peticiones/min",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 23,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "CloudFront · transferencia/min",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "period": 60,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/CloudFront",
            "BytesDownloaded",
            "DistributionId",
            "${distribution_id}",
            "Region",
            "Global",
            {
              "label": "Salida a visitantes"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/CloudFront",
            "BytesUploaded",
            "DistributionId",
            "${distribution_id}",
            "Region",
            "Global",
            {
              "label": "Entrada desde visitantes"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "legend": {
          "position": "bottom"
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "label": "bytes/min",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 23,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "CloudFront · errores HTTP (%)",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "period": 60,
        "stat": "Average",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/CloudFront",
            "4xxErrorRate",
            "DistributionId",
            "${distribution_id}",
            "Region",
            "Global",
            {
              "label": "HTTP 4xx"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/CloudFront",
            "5xxErrorRate",
            "DistributionId",
            "${distribution_id}",
            "Region",
            "Global",
            {
              "label": "HTTP 5xx"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "legend": {
          "position": "bottom"
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "label": "%",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 29,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# Lambda · porcentaje de errores de ejecución\nErrores de ejecución / invocaciones de cada función por minuto. Las respuestas HTTP 5xx se consultan en el dashboard de servicio."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 31,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Lambda · errores de ejecución (%)",
        "region": "${region}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "period": 60,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/Lambda",
            "Invocations",
            "FunctionName",
            "${core_function}",
            {
              "id": "i1",
              "visible": false
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/Lambda",
            "Errors",
            "FunctionName",
            "${core_function}",
            {
              "id": "e1",
              "visible": false
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "expression": "IF(i1>0,100*e1/i1)",
              "id": "r1",
              "label": "core_api"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/Lambda",
            "Invocations",
            "FunctionName",
            "${ai_function}",
            {
              "id": "i2",
              "visible": false
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/Lambda",
            "Errors",
            "FunctionName",
            "${ai_function}",
            {
              "id": "e2",
              "visible": false
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "expression": "IF(i2>0,100*e2/i2)",
              "id": "r2",
              "label": "ai_api"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "legend": {
          "position": "bottom"
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "label": "%",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 37,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 5,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# Lectura de las métricas\n**DynamoDB:** consumo de las tablas base, sin sumar capacidad de sus índices. Las tablas usan pago por petición: no se muestra un porcentaje de capacidad provisionada. Los eventos limitados incluyen tabla y GSI1/GSI2; no equivalen a peticiones únicas. ThrottledRequests distingue diez operaciones de API; en lotes solo se incrementa si todas sus operaciones son limitadas.\n\n**Sin actividad:** pueden faltar series, especialmente las de throttling. Un porcentaje Lambda sin invocaciones no se convierte en 0 %. **Coste:** se reutilizan métricas nativas; no se activan métricas adicionales de CloudFront, alarmas ni consultas de logs."
      }
    }
  ]
}
